# Normalize line endings to LF on checkout so the repository is
# independent of the host platform's core.autocrlf setting.
* text=auto eol=lf

# …EXCEPT Windows batch files: cmd.exe cannot parse LF-only .cmd/.bat files
# (it mis-splits every line, so `rem` comments and commands are executed as
# garbage — 'x' is not recognized — and the script aborts). The desktop build
# pipeline (build-frontend.cmd / before-build.cmd, invoked as tauri.conf's
# beforeBuildCommand) therefore failed and the installer shipped STALE bundled
# resources. Batch files MUST be CRLF on checkout.
*.cmd text eol=crlf
*.bat text eol=crlf
